t(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"GNC Pro Performance(R) AMP Endurance Booster Chews have been developed by GNC scientists and leading exercise and sports nutrition experts to address the three key steps to improving endurance - recovery, stamina and hydration.^"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"With this formula you get superior results before, during and after your activity. Created specifically for elite athletes to improve endurance, AMP Endurance Booster Chews will help you outperform your personal best, and the competition.\nPhase 1: AMP Endurance Booster Chews protect the body from the damaging effects of free radicals and provide the building blocks the body needs to recover from intense sporting activity. Quite simply, these chews help you bounce back and come back better than ever.\nPhase 2: Boosting your athletic performance takes more energy in the body, and more stamina to stay out there and push harder. AMP Endurance Booster Chews give your body the rapid source of clean energy it needs to get moving quickly and provides the sustained energy sources you need to keep pushing long after you've started.\nPhase 3: Peak athletic performance can't happen without proper hydration. By providing key electrolytes and clinically studied key ingredients, AMP Endurance Booster Chews keep your body hydrated.^ With improved hydration you reduce the risk of cramping, helping you push that much harder, for longer."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Sustamine(TM) is a trademark of Kyowa Hakko Bio Co., Ltd."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"^When used in conjunction with adequate fluid intake.\nES310301"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"ADVANCED MUSCLE PERFORMANCE\nAdvanced, 3-phase hydration complex"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{arrow} Improves Hydration & Combats Cramping for Better Performance^*\n{arrow} Provides Rapid & Sustained Energy for Better Stamina & Recovery*\n{arrow} Powered with Critical Aminos + Quercetin for More Energy During Intense Exercise*"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"{beaker} Clinically Researched\n{circle} Daily\n{circle} Pre-Workout\n{circle heartbeat line} Recovery\n{circle water drop} Hydration"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural flavor"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 791292 LMG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, chew one wafer up to three times daily. Drink 6 or 8 fl. oz. of water with each serving."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 11226 4","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}